      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "That feeling of exhaustion from pretending is so real, and it's completely valid to feel like nothing will ever change. If you're not sure what the point is, maybe the point is just to take the next small step toward relief, even if it feels tiny. A professional can help you find a path where you don't have to perform, but you have to let them in first.",
      "source": "target",
